 "face": {
  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "No face but two ember eyes in the dark of the hood: each eye is a matte crescent patch (lo_eyes) laid on the dark face egg, a hot core along its spine fading to ember and a thin halo, glowing (the glow map); a soft ember halo is painted on the face round each. No mouth (the jaw is merged into the head). Expressions in clips' `faces` are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each crescent squashes onto a thin line and sinks into the face, where a faint arc is painted. The core's warm light, the embers, the cut edges and the cloth's underside by the hems glow too.",
